From 4c3016fed8b1e5f93f452584d2e84a346275d8b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 09:53:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] refactor(rfork): harden YuanRong weight transfer and
 session lifecycle

Manage RFork leases, registered tensor storage, seed services, heartbeat, fallback and shutdown through RForkSession. Validate compatibility fingerprints and manifests, preserve alias coverage, and integrate logical/backing memory registration with YuanRong TransferEngine.

Acquire leases after model preparation, release them asynchronously with configurable retry and heartbeat policies, preserve model state during fallback, and safely reuse fully shared draft weights. Add regression coverage and synchronize English/Chinese architecture, configuration and validation documentation.

Prior validation: 133 CPU-isolated tests and 31 backend tests with dependency stubs passed. Full vLLM and NPU/RDMA integration validation remains pending.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
