+"摘要，因此种子实例和接收实例必须运行相同的 RFork 协议才能推导出相同的键。"
+
+msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
+msgstr "### 规划器职责"
+
+msgid "Lease release runs asynchronously after transfer. Planner release requests never hold the session lock. The client makes at most `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` release attempts per lease (default: `3`, including the initial request), waiting `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` seconds (default: `30.0`) between transient failures (network errors, HTTP 408/429, or 5xx). These settings affect lease release only. Other rejected responses stop immediately even when attempts remain; HTTP 200 and 404 retain their existing acknowledgement semantics. The public synchronous release helper uses the same configured max-attempt and retry-interval values. Failed releases do not reload valid weights or prevent model loading from continuing, but the worker is not advertised as a new seed until release is acknowledged. After retry exhaustion, the unresolved lease remains recorded and requires planner-side investigation/recovery. Shutdown does not wait for release I/O and retains TransferEngine resources if release is unresolved."
+msgstr "租约释放在传输完成后异步执行。规划器释放请求不会持有 session 锁。客户端对每个租约最多执行 `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` 次释放尝试（默认值：`3`，包括初始请求），在可重试故障（网络错误、HTTP 408/429 或 5xx）之间等待 `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` 秒（默认值：`30.0`）。这些设置仅影响租约释放。即使仍有剩余次数，其他被拒绝的响应也会立即停止；HTTP 200 和 404 继续沿用现有确认语义。公开的同步释放辅助函数使用相同的已配置最大尝试次数和重试间隔值。释放失败不会重新加载有效权重，也不会阻止模型继续加载，但在释放得到确认前，worker 不会作为新的 seed 上报。重试耗尽后，未解决的租约仍会被记录，需要规划器侧调查/恢复。关闭过程不会等待释放 I/O；如果释放未解决，仍会保留 TransferEngine 资源。"
+
+msgid "The example planner reclaims abandoned leases after 60 seconds by default, independently of seed heartbeat expiry. Configure a positive integer duration with `--lease-ttl-sec` or `RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC`; an explicit CLI value takes precedence over a valid environment value. The loader acquires its lease after model initialization and any required layout preparation/synchronization. Size the timeout for memory registration, metadata fetch, transfer and asynchronous release, including retry delays. Initialization and layout timings are logged separately. Seed heartbeats do not renew leases. Expired leases return 404 on release, which the current client accepts as already released; successful startup alone does not prove that the lease remained valid throughout transfer."
+msgstr "示例规划器默认在 60 秒后回收遗留租约，此机制独立于 seed 心跳过期。可通过 `--lease-ttl-sec` 或 `RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC` 设置正整数秒数；显式 CLI 值优先于有效的环境变量值。加载器在模型初始化及必要的布局准备和同步完成后才获取租约。超时应覆盖内存注册、元数据获取、传输及异步释放，包括重试等待。初始化和布局处理耗时分别记录。Seed 心跳不会续租。过期租约释放时返回 404，当前客户端将其视为已经释放；启动成功并不证明租约在整个传输期间都有效。"
+
+msgid "If no seed is available after preparation, the loader discards the prepared model and loads from the checkpoint. This adds preparation cost to a seed miss. Before fallback, it restores the pre-attempt compilation registries and rotary cache so shared main/draft state is preserved. Model construction and rollback in a worker are assumed to be serialized. Lease renewal is not enabled: it requires explicit support from both planner and client."
+msgstr "准备完成后如果没有可用 seed，加载器会丢弃已准备的模型并从检查点加载，因此 seed 未命中会增加准备成本。回退前会恢复本次尝试之前的编译注册表和旋转位置编码缓存，保留 main/draft 共享状态。此逻辑假设同一 worker 内的模型构造和回退串行执行。当前未启用租约续租，因为这需要规划器和客户端双方明确支持。"
+
+msgid "After an instance becomes ready, each worker periodically reports its seed metadata to the planner. A new instance asks the planner for a seed with the same seed key; the planner selects one with available capacity and returns a lease. A missing or unhealthy seed is not fatal because the destination can use the default loader and later join the seed pool itself."
+msgstr "实例就绪后，每个 worker 会定期向规划器上报 seed 元数据。新实例使用相同的 seed key 向规划器请求 seed；规划器选择仍有可用容量的 seed 并返回租约。缺失或不健康的 seed 不会导致致命错误，因为目标实例可以改用默认加载器，并在随后自行加入 seed 池。"
+
+msgid "The bundled planner demonstrates this workflow, but it is a functional example rather than a production scheduler. A production planner should provide:"
+msgstr "随附的规划器演示了这一流程，但它只是功能示例，而不是生产级调度器。生产环境中的规划器应提供："
+
+msgid "- compatibility matching based on model identity and parallel deployment topology;"
+msgstr "- 基于模型身份和并行部署拓扑进行兼容性匹配；"
+
+msgid "- heartbeat-based health tracking and stale-seed removal;"
+msgstr "- 基于心跳的健康状态跟踪和过期 seed 清理；"
